title: Fibershed
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki
url: https://fibershed.org/

The region that could clothe you: the farms, mills, dyers, and makers close enough to make your clothes from soil to skin.

The idea and the organization come from Rebecca Burgess in Northern California.

A [[material shed|Materialshed]] widens it from fiber to everything a thing is made of.

See [[BioRegion]].
